    <briefdescription>
<para>Deadlock detection error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1DeadlockDetectedError" kindref="compound">DeadlockDetectedError</ref> represents an error where a deadlock condition has been detected between concurrent execution contexts.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1DeadlockDetectedError_1ae0e08d2fb55c0d321ce5483b16a9de62" kindref="member">DeadlockDetectedError</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1DeadlockDetectedError_1ae0e08d2fb55c0d321ce5483b16a9de62" kindref="member">DeadlockDetectedError</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Deadlock<sp/>detected<sp/>between<sp/>worker<sp/>threads&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
